Hi,

please let the title bar of the Common Printing Dialog be one of these 
(if possible):

Print - <document file name> - <application name>
Print - <application name>
Print

As far as I have seen this is the standard. Users do not know what a 
"glib-dialog" is nor they want to use a "Common Printing Dialog Tester".

